[en.FOCUS_C12_EARTH_PONY_MAGIC]
Earth Pony Magic

[en.FOCUS_C12_EARTH_PONY_MAGIC_desc]
Research into ammunition botany has made significant strides and profoundly influenced other similar disciplines, particularly in the study of earth pony magic. We will continue to expand our research findings to benefit our great race of earth ponies, further enhancing their own abilities.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_EARTH_PONY_MAGIC]
陆马魔法

[zh.FOCUS_C12_EARTH_PONY_MAGIC_desc]
对弹药植物学的研究已经取得了长足的进步，并深刻影响了其他类似的学科，尤其是对陆马魔法的研究上，我们将研究成果继续扩大到我们陆马这一伟大种族身上，陆马自身的力量将会得到进一步提高。

